#h1{Appendix: the details}

Everything after this page is here because it is needed and not because it is interesting. A
reader who has come this far knows how the program works; what follows is the rest of what the
program is, in the order of the source, so that the tangled output is complete. The first
chapter holds the plain parts of the program: the entry point, the arguments, the text
comparison, the module file and the stylesheet. The last collects small functions that were
taken out of the chapters above, each placed there by name.
